      "movesets": [
        {
          "name": "Specially Defensive",
          "pokemon": "Solgaleo",
          "shiny": false,
          "gender": "DC",
          "levels": [],
          "description": "<p>Specially defensive Solgaleo is one of the tier's premier special walls, is an amazing pivot, and is even a solid phazer. Knock Off hits Psychic- and Ghost-type Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/mewtwo/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Mewtwo</a>, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/deoxys/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Deoxys</a>, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/giratina/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Giratina</a>, though Sunsteel Strike can be used instead as strong STAB move, to deal more damage to opposing <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus</a> and threaten <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zacian/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zacian</a>. Knock Off's item-removing effect synergizes excellently with Roar's phazing, allowing Solgaleo to remove Heavy-Duty Boots and force foes to take repeated entry hazard damage. Roar also prevents sweepers like Zacian, Mewtwo, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/zamazenta-crowned/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Zamazenta-C</a> from setting up on it. Tera Water removes Solgaleo's Fire and Ground weaknesses, allowing it to check Pokemon like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-fire/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Fire</a>, Trailblaze <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/ogerpon-hearthflame/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Ogerpon-H</a>, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/great-tusk/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Great Tusk</a>. Tera Dark, on the other hand, allows it to check Dark- and Ghost-types, like <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/spectrier/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Spectrier</a>, Giratina, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/chi-yu/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Chi-Yu</a>. Teleport assists in getting powerful wallbreakers like Chi-Yu, Deoxys, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/kyurem-white/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Kyurem-W</a> onto the field safely. Solgaleo can have trouble with Pokemon like Chi-Yu, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/kingambit/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Kingambit</a>, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palafin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palafin</a>, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/landorus/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Landorus</a>, so Pokemon like Kyurem-W, Great Tusk, Zamazenta-C, <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/palkia-origin/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Palkia-O</a>, and <a href=\"/dex/sv/pokemon/arceus-dark/ubers-uu/\" hreflang=\"en\">Arceus-Dark</a> that can check these threats are excellent partners.</p>",
          "abilities": [
            "Full Metal Body"
          ],
          "items": [
            "Leftovers"
          ],
          "teratypes": [
